  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "SBI Card Miles is a travel credit card designed to make your travels more rewarding. It offers Travel Credits as rewards on every card spend with a higher earning rate on travel spends. Though the reward rate of up to 1% struggles to compete with other similar cards, the travel-related redemption options make up for it by offering up to 1:1 points-to miles conversion ratios for 20+ top airline and hotel partners such as Air India, British Airways, Etihad Airways, IHG Hotels & Resorts, Radisson Hotels and many more. Other travel benefits include complimentary airport lounge access and spend-based bonus Travel credits and card fee reversal. Entirely focused on travel, this card is suitable for those who wish to get an agnostic travel credit card for domestic travels and is the base variant among other such SBI Card offerings – SBI Card Miles Prime and Miles Elite.",
    "highlights": [
      "On Travel Spends: 2 Travel Credits on every Rs. 200 spent",
      "On Other Spends: 1 Travel Credit on every Rs. 200 spent",
      "Redemption Options: You can redeem the accrued reward points against the following options –",
      "1 Travel Credit = Up to Rs. 1 for Air Miles or Hotel Points conversion"
    ],
    "welcome_benefit": "Welcome Bonus: 1,500 Travel Credits on reaching Rs. 30,000 card spends within 60 days of card issuance after joining fee payment",
    "milestone_benefits": [
